+## Deploy to Wasmer Edge
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=mermaid-js%2Fmermaid-live-editor)
+
+Fork this repository and import your fork if you want to customize it: the import builds from the repository you choose and does not copy it into your GitHub account. The root `Staticfile` points Wasmer at the `docs/` build output. The build uses the `MERMAID_*` defaults in `.env` (PNG/SVG links via `https://mermaid.ink`, Kroki links via `https://kroki.io`, Mermaid Chart links enabled, analytics disabled); edit `.env` in your fork to change them (see the options below).
+
 ## Docker
 
 ### Run published image
diff --git a/Staticfile b/Staticfile
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3ef78c9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Staticfile
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+root: docs
